          %h2#literature Literature
          %p For the pairwise compatibility of localizations see
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fred+Van+Oystaeyen"}> Fred Van Oystaeyen
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Compatibility of kernel functors and localization functors
                %strong 28
                (1976), no. 2, 131–137.
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alain+Verschoren"}> Alain Verschoren
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Compatibility and stability
              %p Notas de Matemática [Mathematical Notes], 3. Universidad de Murcia, Secretariado de Publicaciones e Intercambio Científico, Murcia, 1990. xii+81 pp. ISBN: 84-7684-934-6
            %li
              %p
                J. Mulet, A. Verschoren,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On compatibility. II.
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00927879208824438"} doi
            %li
              %p
                M. I. Segura, D. Tarazona, A. Verschoren,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On compatibility
                %strong 17
                (1989), no. 3, 677–690.
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1080/00927878908823751"} doi
          %p The compatibility of coactions with Ore localizations is introduced in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zoran+%C5%A0koda"}> Zoran Škoda
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Localizations for construction of quantum coset spaces
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 61
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math.QA/0301090"} math.QA/0301090
          %p The compatibilities between localization functors with endofunctors is formulated in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/V.+A.+Lunts"}> V. A. Lunts
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A.+L.+Rosenberg"} A. L. Rosenberg
              = succeed "," do
                %em Differential calculus in noncommutative algebraic geometry I. D-calculus on noncommutative rings
              %a{:href => "http://www.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/preprints/send?bid=3894"} pdf
          %p A version with distributive laws is introduced in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zoran+%C5%A0koda"}> Zoran Škoda
              , Some equivariant constructions in noncommutative algebraic geometry, Georgian Mathematical Journal 16 (2009), No. 1, 183–202,
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0811.4770"} arXiv:0811.4770
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
